OL,5,G0235 The Cut Price Comedy Show
OL,6,     FComedy Sketch show first shown on
OL,7,     Fthe newly launched Channel 4 in
OL,8,     F1982. Filmed in front of live
OL,9,     Fstudio audience, it's not just the
OL,10,     Fjokes that are cut price!
OL,11,G0300 Randall and Hopkirk (Deceased)
OL,12,     FJeff and Marty investigate a
OL,13,     Fsupposedly haunted manor and find
OL,14,     Fjewel thieves using scares to hide
OL,15,     Ftheir den.
OL,16,G0400 Drop The Dead Donkey
OL,17,     FThere's bad news for George about
OL,18,     Fhis daughter, bad news for Damien
OL,19,     Fabout a bet he's made and bad news
OL,20,     Ffor God about Sally - she's still
OL,21,     Fa Christian...
